WEBVTT

00:00:03.106 --> 00:00:04.904
<v><b>A:</b></v> Would you <b>like</b> to <b>go</b> to <b>Australia</b>?

00:00:05.217 --> 00:00:06.357
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, I <b>wouldn’t</b>.

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:07.385
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Why not</b>?

00:00:07.409 --> 00:00:10.273
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Because</b> I <b>don’t like snakes</b> or <b>insects</b>.